      "quote": "When the ears of the student are ready to hear, then cometh the lips to fill them with Wisdom.",
      "reflection": "I heard this teaching a hundred times before I heard it once. Nothing was missing in the words - something was missing in me. Step 1 is the great ear-opening: admitting we were disconnected made us ready, and suddenly teachers were everywhere - in the drum, in the river, in the stranger at the circle.",
